# Vendored third-party source and build output. llama.cpp is fetched by
# tools/fetch-llm.sh at a pinned revision; it is not our source to carry.
vendor/
# Model weights are game DATA, distributed with the build rather than tracked
# in git. See docs/decisions-d20.md for which model and why.
game/models/*.gguf
!game/models/README.md
build/

# The Godot engine binary: a 138 MB tool you download, not source we wrote.
# GitHub refuses anything over 100 MB, and it does not belong in history.
Godot_v*_linux.x86_64
Godot_v*
